        {"zh": "把血往我这边滴。", "en": "Let the blood drip my way."},
        {"zh": "这根藤够长了", "en": "This vine is long enough."},
        {"zh": "我只要一点", "en": "I need only a little."},
        {"zh": "那点血味太淡了。", "en": "That smell of blood is too faint."},
        {"zh": "你手上的东西在晃", "en": "That thing in your hand is swaying."}
